<title>ESTONIA: EESTI TELEFON SETS NEW CP ISSUE.</title>
<headline>EESTI TELEFON SETS NEW CP ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Telefon has renewed its 30 million kroon commercial paper programme, which will also mature in three months, Hansapank money market trader Ege Metsandi said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>She told Reuters that the new Eesti Telefon paper carries a slightly lower discount rate of 8.2 percent versus the previous issue's rate of 8.27 percent.</p>
<p>The settlement date for the new issue and the maturity date for the old issue are tomorrow. She said the new issue had all been sold out.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroon +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
